po"><addressbook><name>FUJITA KUNIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIGAKI EIICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address> </addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIGAKI MECH IND</name><address><country>JP</country></address> </addressbook> </applicant> <applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KATAYAMA MASAYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORI TOORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NASU MASAFUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITA, KUNIO</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIGAKI COMPANY LIMITED</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIGAKI, EIICHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATAYAMA, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORI, TOORU</name></addressbook></applicant><applicant status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NASU, MASAFUMI</name></addressbook></applicant></applicants><inventors><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>FUJITA KUNIO</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>ISHIGAKI EIICHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>KATAYAMA MASAYOSHI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>MORI TOORU</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="epo"><addressbook><name>NASU MASAFUMI</name><address><country>JP</country></address></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>FUJITA, KUNIO</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>ISHIGAKI, EIICHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>KATAYAMA, MASAYOSHI</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>MORI, TOORU</name></addressbook></inventor><inventor status="new" format="intermediate"><addressbook><name>NASU, MASAFUMI</name></addressbook></inventor></inventors></parties></bibliographic-data><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="EN"><p>A continuous squeeze-dewatering device, comprising a filtration chamber (3), an impeller (15), a drive shaft (17) to rotate the impeller (15), and a feed path (50) to supply liquid concentrate into the filtration chamber (3) through the drive shaft (17), wherein filtrate flows to the outside of the filtration chamber (3) through a screen (4) by the pressure of the liquid concentrate flowing from the feed path (50) to the filtration chamber (3) and the rotation of the impeller (15), and cakes remaining in the filtration chamber (3) are forced out of the filtration chamber (3) through a removal port (7).</p></abstract><abstract load-source="docdb" source="national office" status="new" lang="FR"><p>L'invention concerne un dispositif d'égouttage par serrage continu, qui comporte une chambre de filtration (3), une roue à ailettes (15), un arbre d'entraînement (17) pour faire tourner la roue à ailettes (15), et un trajet d'alimentation (50) pour charger un concentré liquide dans la chambre de filtration (3) par l'arbre d'entraînement (17). Le filtrat s'écoule vers l'extérieur de la chambre de filtration (3) à travers un tamis (4) sous la pression du flux de concentré liquide provenant du trajet d'alimentation (50) et s'écoulant vers la chambre de filtration (3), et de la rotation de la roue à ailettes (15). Les dépôts restant dans la chambre de filtration (3) sont expulsés de la chambre de filtration (3) par un orifice (7) d'élimination.</p></abstract><copyright>User acknowledges that the Information Retrieval Facility (IRF) and its third party providers retain all right, title and interest in and to this xml under applicable copyright laws. User acquires no ownership rights to this xml including but not limited to its format. User hereby accepts the terms and conditions of the Licence Agreement set forth at http://www.ir-facility.org/legal/marec/data_licence</copyright></patent-document>